,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sunday, 15th September</span></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>That's a wrap to our guide to UAE public holidays 2024. With the holidays on the horizon, including extended weekends, residents and visitors have ample opportunities to embark on unforgettable adventures. Whether planning a getaway, cultural exploration, or simply relishing moments of tranquility, let this guide be your compass.&nbsp;</p><style>.ck-table-resized td{padding-left:7px;}</style>"}}}],"ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/mercer_feature_d44fbc6a0e.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/mercer_feature_d44fbc6a0e.webp","transform":"340x","format":"webp"}]},{"src_cftle":"i/blog_0442c7ee24.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1000x/blog_0442c7ee24.webp","transform":"1000x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/696x/blog_0442c7ee24.webp","transform":"696x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/339x/blog_0442c7ee24.webp","transform":"339x","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/339x/blog_0442c7ee24.jpg","transform":"339x","format":"jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/696x/blog_0442c7ee24.jpg","transform":"696x","format":"jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1000x/blog_0442c7ee24.jpg","transform":"1000x","format":"jpg"}]}],"seo":{"id":"ce902152-db04-5d74-b9e4-0cac6a8e04f2","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Stay ahead with our comprehensive UAE Public Holidays 2024 guide, including predicted dates. Find out when you'll get long weekends next year.","metaTitle":"Your Guide to UAE Public Holidays 2024 | Provident Estate","strapi_id":130}}},"pageContext"